        "message": "=<p>Dear HR,</p>\n\n<p>A new candidate has been evaluated by the <b>AI Recruitment Platform</b>.</p>\n\n<h3>Candidate Details</h3>\n\n<p><b>Candidate ID:</b> {{$json.candidateId}}</p>\n\n<p><b>Candidate Name:</b> {{$json.candidateName}}</p>\n\n<p><b>Email:</b> {{$json.email}}</p>\n\n<p><b>Phone:</b> {{$json.phone}}</p>\n\n<p><b>Position:</b> {{$json.position}}</p>\n\n<p><b>AI Resume Score:</b> {{$json.resume_score}}</p>\n\n<p><b>AI Recommendation:</b> {{$json.recommendation}}</p>\n\n<p><b>Resume:</b>\n<a href=\"{{$json.resumeLink}}\" target=\"_blank\">View Resume</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>\nPlease review the candidate and choose one of the following actions:\n</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://swan20.app.n8n.cloud/webhook/hr-decisions?candidateId={{$json.candidateId}}&decision=approve\"\nstyle=\"background-color:#28a745;\ncolor:white;\npadding:12px 20px;\ntext-decoration:none;\nborder-radius:6px;\nfont-weight:bold;\ndisplay:inline-block;\">\n✅ Approve Candidate\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://swan20.app.n8n.cloud/webhook/hr-decisions?candidateId={{$json.candidateId}}&decision=reject\"\nstyle=\"background-color:#dc3545;\ncolor:white;\npadding:12px 20px;\ntext-decoration:none;\nborder-radius:6px;\nfont-weight:bold;\ndisplay:inline-block;\">\n❌ Reject Candidate\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<p>Regards,</p>\n\n<p><b>AI Recruitment Platform</b></p>",
